flowchart LR
 T["Trap enters usertrap()"] --> S["Save sepc in trapframe epc"]
 S -->|"User ecall: cause 8"| A["Add 4, then dispatch syscall"]
 S -->|"Load or store page fault: 13 or 15"| F["Check fault address and mapping"]
 F -->|"Repairable"| R["Map the page, leave epc at faulting instruction"]
 F -->|"Invalid access"| K["Mark process killed"]
 A --> N["Return after ecall"]
 R --> O["Retry the same instruction"]
